# Build output.
/target

# Private keys and local environment. Nothing in this repository should ever
# want either, and the `no-committed-keys` push ruleset refuses most of them at
# the ref — this is the copy that stops them reaching a commit at all.
*.pem
*.key
.env

# DragonGuard's intelligence cache. Only the cache: the per-branch baseline
# snapshots beside it are tracked on purpose, because the regression gate
# compares a branch against the default branch's snapshot, and a snapshot
# nothing can read is a gate that always reports "nothing recorded".
.dragon/cache

# Local assistant tooling: a project profile describing this repository's
# security posture and trust boundaries, plus review and design reports. Useful
# working notes, and this repository is public.
.dragon-buddy/
session.txt

# Editors and OS noise.
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store

# rustfmt backups and coverage output.
**/*.rs.bk
*.profraw
/coverage/
